Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:21.13,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1500,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\fs36\frz270\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}之後部落被另一個部落消滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1800,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}但是里子倖存了下來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1750,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}並且住到了沒有孩子的姑姑夫妻家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1700,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}後來他們有了孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1650,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}家裡的氛圍開始變得很尷尬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1600,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}里子經常感覺自己受到排擠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1550,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}於是他們就來問我的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1500,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}能不能收養她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1800,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}但是我的父母平時也都
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1750,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}在國外跑各種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1700,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}沒空照顧里子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1650,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}正好我又一直都說過想要一個妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1600,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}於是就住到我家裡來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但是我父母也是常常在世界各地飛來飛去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:36.44,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,沒有時間照顧小里子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.73,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,而我以前也說過想要一個妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,於是就讓小里子來跟我住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:40.94,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.61,0:16:43.03,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,真是辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:45.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,食人族不會太可怕了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:52.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那我送她去校門那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:55.91,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好 我回教室囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:58.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,小里子 下次見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:01.09,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好 下次再見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.76,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那麼我就回去囉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:07.89,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,能一起吃中餐真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:08.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.31,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你能等我到放學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:14.10,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,放學後要去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:17.98,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,難道我們可以一起做殺手的工作了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我本來是打算回家後再一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,這樣時間就省下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.77,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:23.86,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,聲音太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.24,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,放學之前能不能請你不要太引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,找個地方躲起來等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:32.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:34.83,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:37.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,只是覺得你穿這樣大概沒辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.37,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,很失禮耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我是忍者哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:42.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你們其實是很顯眼的一族嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:43.84,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那是風評被害啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.84,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:46.63,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,就這樣早退好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.55,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,(好好哦)\N城裡的學校這麼自由啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,不 並不是這樣
